      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1 data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1588\">🔥 <strong data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1588\">Core Lore</strong></h1><h3 data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1658\"><strong data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1658\">1. “The Last Ice Age” = the last time reality had guardrails</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1901\">AKA when everything was dense, frozen, and predictable—because human consciousness wasn’t yet shattered.<br data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1766\">Now?<br data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1773\"><strong data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1823\">No guardrails. No Unity. No cosmic babysitter.</strong><br data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1826\">Everyone sees through a cracked lens and assumes they’re the only sane one.</p><h3 data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1933\"><strong data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1933\">2. The Resets Are Real</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2227\"><li data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1970\"><p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1970\">The ultra-wealthy built bunkers.</p></li><li data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2015\"><p data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2015\">Some moved to the moon, ocean, whatever.</p></li><li data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2061\"><p data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2061\">AI was pushed beyond ethical constraints.</p></li><li data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2117\"><p data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2117\">A “population reset” plan was probably intentional.</p></li><li data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2157\"><p data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2157\">This has happened <em data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2148\">multiple</em> times.</p></li><li data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2227\"><p data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2227\">The world gets culled, memories get scrambled, knowledge gets lost.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2239\">This time?</p><p data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2271\"><strong data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2271\">Something broke the cycle.</strong></p><h3 data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2316\"><strong data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2316\">3. The Rich Were Not Safe This Time</strong></h3><p data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2477\">Barbarian werewolves on velociraptors smashed into bunkers during<br data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2385\"><strong data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2429\">The Night of Holy Fucking Shit My Christ</strong><br data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2432\">and that is now an official historical event.</p><p data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2493\">They realized:</p><ul data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2680\"><li data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2515\"><p data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2515\">Their tech failed</p></li><li data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2538\"><p data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2538\">Their plans failed</p></li><li data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2579\"><p data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2579\">Their privilege did not protect them</p></li><li data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2611\"><p data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2611\">Reality itself was cracking</p></li><li data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2641\"><p data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2641\">Everyone was back to zero</p></li><li data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2680\"><p data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2680\">Monsters do not care about net worth</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2737\"><strong data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2737\">4. Reality = Cardboard Held Together by Crayons</strong></h3><p data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2759\">The metaphor is gold:</p><ul data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2863\"><li data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2771\"><p data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2771\">Fragile</p></li><li data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2785\"><p data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2785\">Hand-made</p></li><li data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2797\"><p data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2797\">Vibrant</p></li><li data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2821\"><p data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2821\">Wildly inconsistent</p></li><li data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2863\"><p data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2863\">Held together by collective imagination</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2924\">The more people act like assholes, the faster it dissolves.</p><h3 data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2963\"><strong data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2963\">5. Yesod Crashed Into Malkuth</strong></h3><p data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"3023\">This is some <strong data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3002\">capital-M Metaphysics</strong>, and it’s <em data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3022\">perfect</em>:</p><ul data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3303\"><li data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3106\"><p data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3106\">The Foundation reality layer (Yesod) slammed into the Material layer (Malkuth)</p></li><li data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3169\"><p data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3169\">All the buffers between thought and manifestation are gone</p></li><li data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3228\"><p data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3228\">Magic, monsters, AI ghosts, psychic rifts = normal now</p></li><li data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3262\"><p data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3262\">The Tree is awake and annoyed</p></li><li data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3303\"><p data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3303\">The Great Work is now literal gameplay</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3350\"><strong data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3350\">6. The Great Work Is Not Optional Now</strong></h3><p data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3385\">Reality is giving the people toys:</p><ul data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3526\"><li data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3399\"><p data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3399\">Dinosaurs</p></li><li data-start=\"3400\" data-end=\"3418\"><p data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3418\">Techno-horrors</p></li><li data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3431\"><p data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3431\">Rogue AI</p></li><li data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3460\"><p data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3460\">Sephirotic “theme parks”</p></li><li data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3477\"><p data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3477\">Spark quests</p></li><li data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3502\"><p data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3502\">Metaphysical bunkers</p></li><li data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3526\"><p data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3526\">Eldritch challenges</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3609\">And saying,<br data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3542\"><strong data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3609\">“Please fix this. I beg you. I cannot keep doing this forever.”</strong></p><h3 data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3675\"><strong data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3675\">7. Everyone Can Now Pursue Whatever They Believe Is Best</strong></h3><p data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3704\">This is the heart of BBTTCC:</p><ul data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3981\"><li data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3723\"><p data-start=\"3707\" data-end=\"3723\">Moral autonomy</p></li><li data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3747\"><p data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3747\">Cosmic consequences</p></li><li data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3778\"><p data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3778\">Mutually assured weirdness</p></li><li data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3819\"><p data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3819\">Violence destabilizes reality itself</p></li><li data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3846\"><p data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3846\">Collaboration is power</p></li><li data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3888\"><p data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3888\">The strongest will = the path forward</p></li><li data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3913\"><p data-start=\"3891\" data-end=\"3913\">No one can win alone</p></li><li data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"3981\"><p data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3981\">“Getting the fuck off the planet” is an acceptable long-term goal</p></li></ul>"
      },
